      "desc:8": "The Z2 viva: prove the network lives. Show the organs of a working autocrafting system — controller, drive, interface, assembler, crafting storage, both buses, and a fistful of patterns. Nothing is consumed; this is inspection, not tax.\n\nPass, and the graduation grant lands: 64k cells for the hoard, advanced crafting storage for the CPUs, a fat coin purse, and the pick of a lootbag.\n\nFrom here the AE line proper takes over — advanced cells, spatial IO at scale — while Z3 waits to industrialize your steam. You came for a storage chest; you leave with a factory that runs itself.",
